s="gallery-caption">Engineering &amp; restoration · Placeholder</div></div><div class="gallery-photo"><div class="gallery-placeholder">PHOTO TO BE ADDED</div><div class="gallery-caption">Flying &amp; events · Placeholder</div></div><div class="gallery-photo"><div class="gallery-placeholder">PHOTO TO BE ADDED</div><div class="gallery-caption">Historical archive · Placeholder</div></div></div></div><div class="gallery-panel" id="gallery-3"><h3>Sioux AH.1 — photo gallery</h3><div class="gallery-grid"><div class="gallery-photo"><div class="gallery-placeholder">PHOTO TO BE ADDED</div><div class="gallery-caption">Cockpit &amp; flight deck · Placeholder</div></div><div class="gallery-photo"><div class="gallery-placeholder">PHOTO TO BE ADDED</div><div class="gallery-caption">Aircraft exterior · Placeholder</div></div><div class="gallery-photo"><div class="gallery-placeholder">PHOTO TO BE ADDED</div><div class="gallery-caption">Engineering &amp; restoration · Placeholder</div></div><div class="gallery-photo"><div class="gallery-placeholder">PHOTO TO BE ADDED</div><div class="gallery-caption">Flying &amp; events · Placeholder</div></div><div class="gallery-photo"><div class="gallery-placeholder">PHOTO TO BE ADDED</div><div class="gallery-caption">Historical archive · Placeholder</div></div></div></div><div class="gallery-panel" id="gallery-4"><h3>Auster AOP.9 — photo gallery</h3><div class="gallery-grid"><div class="gallery-photo"><button aria-label="Enlarge Auster AOP.9 photograph" class="gallery-open" type="button"><img alt="HAAF Auster AOP.9 XR244 on the apron at Middle Wallop" src="images/auster-wallop.jpg"/></button><div class="gallery-caption">Auster AOP.9 XR244 · Aircraft exterior</div></div><div class="gallery-photo"><div class="gallery-placeholder">PHOTO TO BE ADDED</div><div class="gallery-caption">Aircraft exterior · Placeholder</div></div><div class="gallery-photo"><div class="gallery-placeholder">PHOTO TO BE ADDED</div><div class="gallery-caption">Engineering &amp; restoration · Placeholder</div></div><div class="gallery-photo"><div class="gallery-placeholder">PHOTO TO BE ADDED</div><div class="gallery-caption">Flying &amp; events · Placeholder</div></div><div class="gallery-photo"><div class="gallery-placeholder">PHOTO TO BE ADDED</div><div class="gallery-caption">Historical archive · Placeholder</div></div></div></div><div class="gallery-panel" id="gallery-5"><h3>de Havilland Chipmunk T.10 — photo gallery</h3><div class="gallery-grid"><div class="gallery-photo"><div class="gallery-placeholder">PHOTO TO BE ADDED</div><div class="gallery-caption">Cockpit &amp; flight deck · Placeholder</div></div><div class="gallery-photo"><div class="gallery-placeholder">PHOTO TO BE ADDED</div><div class="gallery-caption">Aircraft exterior · Placeholder</div></div><div class="gallery-photo"><div class="gallery-placeholder">PHOTO TO BE ADDED</div><div class="gallery-caption">Engineering &amp; restoration · Placeholder</div></div><div class="gallery-photo"><div class="gallery-placeholder">PHOTO TO BE ADDED</div><div class="gallery-caption">Flying &amp; events · Placeholder</div></div><div class="gallery-photo"><div class="gallery-placeholder">PHOTO TO BE ADDED</div><div class="gallery-caption">Historical archive · Placeholder</div></div></div></div><div class="gallery-panel" id="gallery-6"><h3>Taylorcraft (Auster) Mk.1 — photo gallery</h3><div class="gallery-grid"><div class="gallery-photo"><div class="gallery-placeholder">PHOTO TO BE ADDED</div><div class="gallery-caption">Cockpit &amp; flight deck · Placeholder</div></div><div class="gallery-photo"><div class="gallery-placeholder">PHOTO TO BE ADDED</div><div class="gallery-caption">Aircraft exterior · Placeholder</div></div><div class="gallery-photo"><div class="gallery-placeholder">PHOTO TO BE ADDED</div><div class="gallery-caption">Engineering &amp; restoration · Placeholder</div></div><div class="gallery-photo"><div class="gallery-placeholder">PHOTO TO BE ADDED</div><div class="gallery-caption">Flying &amp; events · Placeholder</div></div><div class="gallery-photo"><div class="gallery-placeholder">PHOTO TO BE ADDED</div><div class="gallery-caption">Historical archive · Placeholder</div></div></div></div></div><p class="gallery-note">Gallery draft: the Beaver cockpit image is supplied by HAAF for this review. Other galleries contain labelled placeholders awaiting approved photographs. Photo credits and usage permissions should be confirmed before publication.</p></div></section><section class="section" id="visiting-aircraft"><div class="wrap"><div class="heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">GUEST AIRCRAFT AT MIDDLE WALLOP</div><h2>Visiting Aircraft</h2></div><p>A selection of aircraft photographed during visits to the hangar. These are visiting aircraft, not part of the HAAF collection.</p></div><div class="visiting-grid"><article class="visiting-card"><button aria-label="Enlarge Visiting historic aircraft — hangar photograph" class="gallery-open" type="button"><img alt="Historic dark-coloured military aircraft displayed inside a hangar" src="images/visiting-aircraft.jpg"/></button><h3>Visiting historic aircraft — hangar photograph</h3><p>Guest aircraft photograph · Aircraft details and photo credit to be confirmed</p></article><article class="visiting-card"><button aria-label="Enlarge Visiting Spitfire — hangar photograph" class="gallery-open" type="button"><img alt="Camouflaged Spitfire with RAF roundel inside the hangar" src="images/spitfire.jpg"/></button><h3>Visiting Spitfire — hangar photograph</h3><p>Guest aircraft photograph · Aircraft details and photo credit to be confirmed</p></article></div><p class="visiting-note">Visiting aircraft are shown for interest and may not be present during public visits. Photographs are not an indication of current availability.</p></div></section><section class="section dark" id="visit"><div class="wrap"><div class="heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">EXPERIENCE HAAF</div><h2>Get closer to history</h2></div><p>From hangar visits to public appearances, discover ways to experience the Flight.</p></div><div class="features"><div class="feature"><div class="number">01</div><h3>Hangar visits</h3><p>Learn about our aircraft, the engineering and the volunteers who keep them in the public eye.</p><a class="arrow" href="mailto:info@haaf.uk?subject=Hangar%20visit%20enquiry">ENQUIRE ABOUT VISITS →</a></div><div class="feature"><div class="number">02</div><h3>Events &amp; appearances</h3><p>See upcoming public events, displays and the plans for our 2027 season.</p><a class="arrow" href="#events">SEE EVENTS →</a></div><div class="feature"><div class="number">03</div><h3>Behind the scenes</h3><p>Follow maintenance, restoration and the people behind the aircraft.</p><a class="arrow" href="#about">OUR STORY →</a></div></div></div></section><section class="section" id="appearances"><div class="wrap"><div class="heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">VETERANS · REMEMBRANCE · COMMUNITY</div><h2>Aircraft Appearances &amp; Events</h2></div><p>Bringing British Army aviation heritage to commemorations, veterans' gatherings and public events.</p></div><div class="appearance-grid">
<article class="appearance-card"><img alt="HAAF DHC-2 Beaver XP820 on the ground" src="images/beaver-ground.jpg"/><div class="appearance-body"><h3>Veterans &amp; Remembrance</h3><p>We welcome enquiries for regimental reunions, veterans' gatherings, remembrance occasions, Royal British Legion and Poppy Appeal events. Our aircraft help tell the stories of those who served.</p><small>Participation is considered individually; no organisational endorsement is implied.</small></div></article>
<article class="appearance-card"><img alt="HAAF Auster AOP.9 XR244 — example of an aircraft available for appearance enquiries" src="images/auster-appearance.jpg"/><div class="appearance-body"><h3>Flypasts &amp; Special Occasions</h3><p>Enquire about military funeral and memorial flypasts, airshows, weddings and other appropriate events. Each request is assessed for aircraft and crew availability, operational feasibility and required permissions.</p><small>Photograph: HAAF Beaver XP820 on the ground; illustrative of the aircraft, not a flypast.</small></div></article>
<article class="appearance-card"><img alt="Skeeter helicopter in flight, historic reference image" src="images/skeeter-flight.jpg"/><div class="appearance-body"><h3>Skeeter — Tow-in Static Display</h3><p>Our non-flying Skeeter is available for consideration as a transported static exhibit at suitable village shows, veterans' gatherings, Poppy Appeals and community events.</p><small>Historic flying photograph; HAAF's display aircraft is non-flying.</small></div></article>
<article class="appearance-card"><img alt="Army Gazelle helicopter on the ground, historical reference image credited Dave Taskis" src="images/gazelle-ground.jpg"/><div class="appearance-body"><h3>Gazelle — Tow-in Static Display</h3><p>Our non-flying Gazelle can be brought to suitable events as a static display, subject to transport, access, site suitability and volunteer availability.</p><small>Photo: Dave Taskis / Helis.com (credit visible on supplied image; reuse permission to confirm).</small></div></article>
</div><div class="notice"><strong>Planning an appearance?</strong> Please contact us early. Enquiries do not constitute confirmed bookings. All appearances depend on feasibility, transport or flying arrangements, insurance and necessary authorisations. STEM and educational visits are handled separately on our <a href="#stem">STEM &amp; Education page</a>.</div>
<div class="event-form"><h3>Request an Aircraft Appearance</h3><p>Tell us about your event and we will review the request. This demonstration opens your email application; the WordPress version will use a secure enquiry form.</p><form id="haaf-appearance-form" name="appearance-enquiry" method="POST" data-netlify="true" netlify-honeypot="bot-field">
<p style="display:none;"><label>Don’t fill this out: <input name="bot-field" /></label></p>><div class="form-cols"><div><label for="ev-type">Event type</label><select id="ev-type" required=""><option>Veterans or regimental event</option><option>Royal British Legion / Poppy Appeal</option><option>Remembrance / military funeral</option><option>Village show / community event</option><option>Wedding / private occasion</option><option>Airshow / public event</option><option>Other</option></select></div><div><label for="ev-aircraft">Appearance requested</label><select id="ev-aircraft"><option>Skeeter static display</option><option>Gazelle static display</option><option>Both static aircraft</option><option>Flying appearance / flypast</option><option>Other / advice requested</option></select></div><div><label for="ev-date">Proposed date</label><input id="ev-date" type="date"/></div><div><label for="ev-location">Venue / location</label><input id="ev-location" placeholder="Town, venue and postcode" required=""/></div><div><label for="ev-name">Name / organisation</label><input id="ev-name" required=""/></div><div><label for="ev-email">Your email</label><input id="ev-email" required="" type="email"/></div></div><label for="ev-details">Event details and site access (if static display)</label><textarea id="ev-details" placeholder="Event time, audience, access for towing vehicle/trailer, available display area and any special requirements" rows="4"></textarea><button type="submit">Prepare Enquiry Email</button></form></div></div></section><section class="section" id="events"><div class="wrap"><div class="heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">LOOKING AHEAD</div><h2>The 2027 season</h2></div><p>News, upcoming appearances and special events will be published here when confirmed.</p></div><div class="grid2"><div class="tile"><div class="tilebody"><div class="eyebrow">PLANNED · DETAILS TO FOLLOW</div><h3>2027 Relaunch Dinner</h3><p>A proposed April event celebrating the Flight and the people who support it. Booking information to follow once confirmed.</p></div></div><div class="tile"><div class="tilebody"><div class="eyebrow">PROGRAMME IN DEVELOPMENT</div><h3>Airshows &amp; public events</h3><p>Find out where to meet the HAAF team and see our historic aircraft during the season.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="section" id="stem"><div class="wrap"><div class="heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">INSPIRING THE NEXT GENERATION</div><h2>STEM &amp; Education</h2></div><p>Explore science, technology, engineering and mathematics through the aircraft and people of HAAF.</p></div><p class="stem-intro">Historic aircraft provide a unique opportunity to see engineering in the real world. We welcome expressions of interest from students, teachers, colleges and cadet leaders who want to explore aviation and engineering. All proposed visits and activities are subject to availability, safeguarding arrangements and site approval.</p><div class="grid2" style="margin-top:28px"><article class="stem-card"><div class="stem-icon">⚙</div><h3>Future Aircraft Engineers</h3><p>Thinking about a career in engineering? Discover the different skills needed to inspect, maintain and preserve aircraft, and learn about possible training, apprenticeship and career routes. Ask us about suitable opportunities to meet volunteer engineers.</p><a class="arrow" href="#contact">ASK ABOUT ENGINEERING →</a></article><article class="stem-card"><div class="stem-icon">✎</div><h3>School Visits</h3><p>Introduce pupils to flight, forces, materials, teamwork and aviation history. Potential activities include aircraft familiarisation, questions with engineers and age-appropriate practical demonstrations, tailored to what HAAF can safely offer.</p><a class="arrow" href="#contact">ENQUIRE ABOUT A SCHOOL VISIT →</a></article><article class="stem-card"><div class="stem-icon">⌁</div><h3>College &amp; Technical Students</h3><p>Explore aircraft structures, propulsion, maintenance practices, safety, documentation and the engineering decisions involved in caring for historic aircraft. Enquiries from engineering tutors and course leaders are welcome.</p><a class="arrow" href="#contact">ENQUIRE ABOUT A COLLEGE VISIT →</a></article><article class="stem-card"><div class="stem-icon">✦</div><h3>Army &amp; RAF Cadets</h3><p>For Army Cadet and RAF Air Cadet units: explore Army aviation heritage, aircraft roles, engineering and possible group visits. Cadet leaders can contact HAAF to discuss a suitable educational programme.</p><a class="arrow" href="#contact">ENQUIRE ABOUT A CADET VISIT →</a></article></div><div class="heading" style="margin-top:52px"><div><div class="eyebrow">HOW IT WORKS</div><h2>Arrange an educational enquiry</h2></div></div><div class="stem-steps"><div class="stem-step"><strong>01 · Tell us about your group</strong><p>Share the age range, number of visitors and the topics you would like to explore.</p></div><div class="stem-step"><strong>02 · Discuss what's possible</strong><p>Our volunteers can consider suitable dates, activities, access and supervision requirements.</p></div><div class="stem-step"><strong>03 · Confirm the arrangements</strong><p>Visits proceed only after HAAF confirms availability, permissions and any relevant safety arrangements.</p></div></div><div style="margin-top:30px"><a class="btn" href="#contact">CONTACT THE STEM TEAM</a></div></div></section><section class="section dark" id="support"><div class="wrap"><div class="support-intro"><span class="eyebrow">SUPPORT THE HISTORIC ARMY AIRCRAFT FLIGHT</span><h2>Help Keep History Flying</h2><p class="support-lead">Every aircraft has a story. Every volunteer helps preserve it. Your support helps us care for historic Army aircraft, share their history and inspire the next generation of aviation engineers.</p><p class="support-tagline">Preserved by volunteers. Supported by you.</p></div><div class="support-grid"><article class="support-panel support-feature"><span class="support-kicker">ONE-OFF GIVING</span><h3>Make a contribution</h3><p>Choose an amount that feels right for you. Every contribution helps protect and share Army aviation heritage.</p><div aria-label="Suggested donation amount" class="amounts" role="group"><button class="amount-button" data-amount="10" type="button">£10</button><button aria-pressed="true" class="amount-button selected" data-amount="25" type="button">£25</button><button class="amount-button" data-amount="50" type="button">£50</button><button class="amount-button" data-amount="100" type="button">£100</button></div><label class="custom-amount">Or enter your own amount (£)<input id="support-custom-amount" inputmode="numeric" min="1" placeholder="Other amount" step="1" type="number"/></label><p aria-live="polite" class="support-small" id="support-selection">Selected amount: £25</p><a class="support-action" href="mailto:info@haaf.uk?subject=Supporting%20HAAF%20%E2%80%93%20Donation%20Enquiry" id="donation-enquiry">Enquire about donating →</a><p class="support-small">Prototype only: no payments are taken here. The webmaster can connect an approved secure donation service.</p></article><article class="support-panel"><span class="support-kicker">A LONG-TERM CONNECTION</span><h3>Friends of HAAF</h3><p>Join a proposed community of people who value historic Army aviation. A supporters' scheme could offer news, project updates and invitations to suitable events.</p><p class="support-small"><strong>Proposed scheme:</strong> annual contribution and benefits to be agreed by HAAF management. Membership is not yet open.</p><a class="support-text-link" href="mailto:info@haaf.uk?subject=Interest%20in%20Friends%20of%20HAAF">Register your interest →</a></article><article class="support-panel"><span class="support-kicker">VISIBLE RESULTS</span><h3>Support an aircraft project</h3><p>Help with a defined preservation, maintenance or restoration project, with clear objectives and progress updates.</p><p class="support-small">Specific projects and funding targets will be published once approved.</p><a class="support-text-link" href="mailto:info@haaf.uk?subject=HAAF%20Aircraft%20Project%20Support">Discuss a project →</a></article><article class="support-panel"><span class="support-kicker">PARTNER WITH US</span><h3>Corporate &amp; STEM partnerships</h3><p>Businesses can help preserve aviation heritage and support educational activities for schools, colleges and cadets.</p><a class="support-text-link" href="mailto:info@haaf.uk?subject=HAAF%20Corporate%20or%20STEM%20Partnership">Explore partnership opportunities →</a></article></div></div></section><section class="statement" id="shop"><div class="wrap"><div class="eyebrow">THE FLIGHT SHOP · PRODUCT PREVIEW</div><h2>Aircraft collectables</h2><p>Proposed HAAF merchandise featuring our own designs. Prices, stock and availability are subject to approval. The live WordPress shop will accept postal orders only; this preview takes no payments.</p><div class="haaf-products"><article class="haaf-product"><img alt="HAAF Beaver trolley coin — supplied product photograph" id="trolley-product" src="images/beaver-trolley-coin.jpg"/><div class="haaf-product-body"><h3>DHC Beaver trolley coin</h3><p>Aircraft-design trolley token with keyring clip.</p><p><strong>Indicative price: £3.50–£4.50</strong></p><small>Draft product · Not yet for sale</small></div></article><article class="haaf-product"><img alt="HAAF DHC Beaver XP820 challenge coin — supplied product artwork" id="challenge-product" src="images/beaver-challenge-coin.jpg"/><div class="haaf-product-body"><h3>DHC Beaver XP820 challenge coin</h3><p>Antique gold-effect commemorative design featuring XP820.</p><p><strong>Indicative price: £10–£15</strong></p><small>Draft product · Not yet for sale</small></div></article></div><p class="haaf-shop-note">Future shop: secure checkout, automatic stock updates, volunteer dispatch and UK postal delivery only. No hangar collection.</p></div></section><section class="section" id="about"><div class="wrap"><div class="heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">OUR STORY</div><h2>Preserved by people who care</h2></div><p>Discover HAAF's history, its mission and the volunteers who sustain the collection. The final site should retain the existing historical articles, galleries and testimonials.</p></div><div class="heading" style="margin-top:48px"><div><div class="eyebrow">MEET THE PEOPLE</div><h2>The people behind HAAF</h2></div><p>Meet the volunteers who manage, maintain and support the Flight. Names, photographs and biographies will be added after approval.</p></div><div class="people-sections" id="people"><section class="people-group"><h3>The Board</h3><div class="grid3"><article class="tile person-card"><div aria-label="Photograph placeholder" class="photo-placeholder" role="img">PHOTO<br/>PLACEHOLDER</div><div class="tilebody"><h4>Name / role</h4><p class="bio-placeholder"><strong>Biography placeholder</strong><br/>Add a short biography describing responsibilities, experience and involvement with HAAF.</p></div></article><article class="tile person-card"><div aria-label="Photograph placeholder" class="photo-placeholder" role="img">PHOTO<br/>PLACEHOLDER</div><div class="tilebody"><h4>Name / role</h4><p class="bio-placeholder"><strong>Biography placeholder</strong><br/>Add a short biography describing responsibilities, experience and involvement with HAAF.</p></div></article><article class="tile person-card"><div aria-label="Photograph placeholder" class="photo-placeholder" role="img">PHOTO<br/>PLACEHOLDER</div><div class="tilebody"><h4>Name / role</h4><p class="bio-placeholder"><strong>Biography placeholder</strong><br/>Add a short biography describing responsibilities, experience and involvement with HAAF.</p></div></article></div></section><section class="people-group"><h3>The Management Team</h3><div class="grid3"><article class="tile person-card"><div aria-label="Photograph placeholder" class="photo-placeholder" role="img">PHOTO<br/>PLACEHOLDER</div><div class="tilebody"><h4>Name / role</h4><p class="bio-placeholder"><strong>Biography placeholder</strong><br/>Add a short biography describing responsibilities, experience and involvement with HAAF.</p></div></article><article class="tile person-card"><div aria-label="Photograph placeholder" class="photo-placeholder" role="img">PHOTO<br/>PLACEHOLDER</div><div class="tilebody"><h4>Name / role</h4><p class="bio-placeholder"><strong>Biography placeholder</strong><br/>Add a short biography describing responsibilities, experience and involvement with HAAF.</p></div></article><article class="tile person-card"><div aria-label="Photograph placeholder" class="photo-placeholder" role="img">PHOTO<br/>PLACEHOLDER</div><div class="tilebody"><h4>Name / role</h4><p class="bio-placeholder"><strong>Biography placeholder</strong><br/>Add a short biography describing responsibilities, experience and involvement with HAAF.</p></div></article></div></section><section class="people-group"><h3>The Engineers</h3><div class="grid3"><article class="tile person-card"><div aria-label="Photograph placeholder" class="photo-placeholder" role="img">PHOTO<br/>PLACEHOLDER</div><div class="tilebody"><h4>Name / role</h4><p class="bio-placeholder"><strong>Biography placeholder</strong><br/>Add a short biography describing responsibilities, experience and involvement with HAAF.</p></div></article><article class="tile person-card"><div aria-label="Photograph placeholder" class="photo-placeholder" role="img">PHOTO<br/>PLACEHOLDER</div><div class="tilebody"><h4>Name / role</h4><p class="bio-placeholder"><strong>Biography placeholder</strong><br/>Add a short biography describing responsibilities, experience and involvement with HAAF.</p></div></article><article class="tile person-card"><div aria-label="Photograph placeholder" class="photo-placeholder" role="img">PHOTO<br/>PLACEHOLDER</div><div class="tilebody"><h4>Name / role</h4><p class="bio-placeholder"><strong>Biography placeholder</strong><br/>Add a short biography describing responsibilities, experience and involvement with HAAF.</p></div></article></div></section><section class="people-group"><h3>The Support Team</h3><div class="grid3"><article class="tile person-card"><div aria-label="Photograph placeholder" class="photo-placeholder" role="img">PHOTO<br/>PLACEHOLDER</div><div class="tilebody"><h4>Name / role</h4><p class="bio-placeholder"><strong>Biography placeholder</strong><br/>Add a short biography describing responsibilities, experience and involvement with HAAF.</p></div></article><article class="tile person-card"><div aria-label="Photograph placeholder" class="photo-placeholder" role="img">PHOTO<br/>PLACEHOLDER</div><div class="tilebody"><h4>Name / role</h4><p class="bio-placeholder"><strong>Biography placeholder</strong><br/>Add a short biography describing responsibilities, experience and involvement with HAAF.</p></div></article><article class="tile person-card"><div aria-label="Photograph placeholder" class="photo-placeholder" role="img">PHOTO<br/>PLACEHOLDER</div><div class="tilebody"><h4>Name / role</h4><p class="bio-placeholder"><strong>Biography placeholder</strong><br/>Add a short biography describing responsibilities, experience and involvement with HAAF.</p></div></article></div></section></div><div class="identity-strip"><img alt="HAAF heraldic badge with lion crest" src="images/haaf-heraldic-badge.webp"/><div><strong>Our heritage badge</strong><p>The heraldic badge reflects the Flight’s Army aviation heritage and motto. It sits alongside the proposed contemporary HAAF logo used in the site header.</p><p class="identity-note">Branding shown for internal review; permissions and final approval should be checked before merchandise or public launch.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="section" id="contact" style="background:#e8e5da"><div class="wrap"><div class="heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">GET IN TOUCH</div><h2>Contact HAAF</h2></div><p>For STEM visits, aircraft enquiries, volunteering, events and general questions.</p></div><form class="contact-form" id="enquiry-form"><div class="form-grid"><div class="form-field"><label for="enq-name">Your name *</label><input autocomplete="name" id="enq-name" maxlength="100" required=""/></div><div class="form-field"><label for="enq-email">Email address *</label><input autocomplete="email" id="enq-email" maxlength="150" required="" type="email"/></div><div class="form-field"><label for="enq-org">School, college, unit or organisation</label><input id="enq-org" maxlength="150"/></div><div class="form-field"><label for="enq-type">Enquiry type *</label><select id="enq-type" required=""><option value="">Please select</option><option>Future engineering careers</option><option>School visit</option><option>College visit</option><option>Army Cadets visit</option><option>RAF Air Cadets visit</option><option>General hangar visit</option><option>Volunteering</option><option>Sponsorship</option><option>Other enquiry</option></select></div></div><div class="form-field"><label for="enq-message">Your enquiry *</label><textarea id="enq-message" maxlength="4000" placeholder="For group visits, please include approximate numbers, age range, preferred dates and what you hope to learn." required=""></textarea></div><button class="btn" type="submit">PREPARE EMAIL ENQUIRY →</button><p class="form-note">This demonstration opens your email application with the enquiry prepared for info@haaf.uk. It does not submit or store data on a website. For the live WordPress site, the webmaster should install a secure contact form with anti-spam and appropriate privacy information. Please do not include children's personal details.</p><p class="form-note"><strong>Alternative:</strong> Email <a href="mailto:info@haaf.uk" style="text-decoration:underline">info@haaf.uk</a>. HAAF is volunteer-run, so responses may take time.</p></form></div></section><script>document.getElementById('enquiry-form').addEventListener('submit',function(e){e.preventDefault();const v=id=>document.getElementById(id).value.trim();const subject='HAAF enquiry: '+v('enq-type');const body='Name: '+v('enq-name')+'\nEmail: '+v('enq-email')+'\nOrganisation: '+v('enq-org')+'\nEnquiry: '+v('enq-type')+'\n\n'+v('enq-message');window.location.href='mailto:info@haaf.uk?subject='+encodeURIComponent(subject)+'&body='+encodeURIComponent(body);});</script></main><section aria-labelledby="find-us-title" class="section" id="find-us" style="background:#e9e7df"><div class="wrap"><div class="heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">VISITING HAAF</div><h2 id="find-us-title">How to Find Us</h2><p>Plan your visit to the Historic Army Aircraft Flight at Middle Wallop.</p></div></div><div class="find-us-layout"><div class="find-us-info"><h3>Army Aviation Centre</h3><p>Historic Army Aircraft Flight<br/>Army Aviation Centre<br/>Middle Wallop, Stockbridge<br/>Hampshire <strong>SO20 8DY</strong></p><p><strong>Visits by prior arrangement only.</strong> HAAF operates within a military establishment. Please arrange your visit before travelling; joining instructions and the correct entrance will be confirmed with your booking.</p><a class="btn" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Army+Aviation+Centre+Middle+Wallop+SO20+8DY" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Get Directions ↗</a><p class="find-us-note">The postcode refers to the wider Army Aviation Centre and may not direct you to the visitor entrance.</p></div><div class="find-us-map"><iframe allowfullscreen="" loading="lazy" referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade" src="https://www.google.com/maps?q=Army%20Aviation%20Centre%20Middle%20Wallop%20SO20%208DY&amp;output=embed" title="Map of Army Aviation Centre, Middle Wallop"></iframe><p>Map requires an internet connection. Use the directions link if the map does not display.</p></div></div></div></section><footer class="footer"><div class="footer-brand"><img alt="Proposed HAAF logo" src="images/logo-footer.webp"/></div><div class="wrap"><div><strong>HAAF · Historic Army Aircraft Flight</strong><div class="note">Middle Wallop, Hampshire · Website concept for internal discussion · Find Us: SO20 8DY</div></div><div class="note">Home · Aircraft · Visits · STEM &amp; Education · Contact · Support · Shop<br/>© HAAF · Proposed 2027 website</div></div><p class="identity-note">Website branding concept — proposed new logo and heritage badge for management review.</p></footer><div class="draft">DESIGN CONCEPT · NOT THE LIVE WEBSITE</div><div aria-label="Photograph viewer" aria-modal="true" class="lightbox" id="gallery-lightbox" role="dialog"><button aria-label="Close photograph" class="lightbox-close" type="button">×</button><img alt=""/><p>Cockpit &amp; flight deck · Photo: Moray McGowan</p></div><script>function showGallery(id){document.querySelectorAll('.gallery-panel').forEach(x=>x.classList.toggle('active',x.id==='gallery-'+id));document.querySelectorAll('.gallery-tab').forEach(x=>x.classList.toggle('selected',x.dataset.gallery===id));}document.querySelectorAll('.gallery-tab').forEach(b=>b.addEventListener('click',()=>showGallery(b.dataset.gallery)));document.querySelectorAll('.gallery-card-link').forEach(a=>a.addEventListener('click',()=>showGallery(a.hash.replace('#gallery-',''))));const lightbox=document.getElementById('gallery-lightbox');document.querySelectorAll('.gallery-open').forEach(b=>b.addEventListener('click',()=>{lightbox.querySelector('img').src=b.querySelector('img').src;lightbox.classList.add('open');}));function closeGallery(){lightbox.classList.remove('open')}lightbox.querySelector('button').addEventListener('click',closeGallery);lightbox.addEventListener('click',e=>{if(e.target===lightbox)closeGallery()});document.addEventListener('keydown',e=>{if(e.key==='Escape')closeGallery()});if(location.hash.startsWith('#gallery-'))showGallery(location.hash.replace('#gallery-',''));</script><script>(function(){const buttons=document.querySelectorAll('#support .amount-button');const custom=document.getElementById('support-custom-amount');const output=document.getElementById('support-selection');const link=document.getElementById('donation-enquiry');function setAmount(amount){output.textContent='Selected amount: £'+amount;link.href='mailto:info@haaf.uk?subject='+encodeURIComponent('Supporting HAAF – Donation Enquiry')+'&body='+encodeURIComponent('I would like to ask how to make a donation of £'+amount+' to HAAF.');}buttons.forEach(b=>b.addEventListener('click',()=>{buttons.forEach(x=>{x.classList.remove('selected');x.setAttribute('aria-pressed','false')});b.classList.add('selected');b.setAttribute('aria-pressed','true');custom.value='';setAmount(b.dataset.amount)}));custom.addEventListener('input',()=>{buttons.forEach(x=>{x.classList.remove('selected');x.setAttribute('aria-pressed','false')});const n=Number(custom.value);if(Number.isFinite(n)&&n>=1){setAmount(n)}else{output.textContent='Enter an amount of £1 or more';link.href='mailto:info@haaf.uk?subject=Supporting%20HAAF%20%E2%80%93%20Donation%20Enquiry'}});setAmount('25')})();</script><script>document.getElementById('haaf-appearance-form').addEventListener('submit',function(e){e.preventDefault();const v=id=>document.getElementById(id).value;const body=['Event type: '+v('ev-type'),'Requested aircraft: '+v('ev-aircraft'),'Date: '+v('ev-date'),'Venue: '+v('ev-location'),'Contact: '+v('ev-name'),'Email: '+v('ev-email'),'Details: '+v('ev-details')].join('\n');window.location.href='mailto:info@haaf.uk?subject='+encodeURIComponent('HAAF aircraft appearance enquiry')+'&body='+encodeURIComponent(body);});</script>
